---
import Policy from '../components/Policy.astro';
---
<Policy title="Refund and cancellation policy" titleHi="रिफ़ंड एवं रद्दीकरण नीति" summaryHi="खरीद के 7 दिन के भीतर रिफ़ंड मांग सकते हैं। रिफ़ंड उसी माध्यम से 5–7 कार्य दिवस में लौटाया जाएगा। (यह नीति मालिक द्वारा पुष्टि होना बाकी है।)">
  <p class="note"><strong>Draft: to be confirmed by the owner before launch.</strong></p>
  <p>Effective date: [EFFECTIVE DATE]</p>
  <h2>7-day refund</h2>
  <p>If a pack is not right for you, ask for a refund within 7 days of payment. Write to [SUPPORT EMAIL] or message us on WhatsApp at [SUPPORT PHONE] with your registered phone number and payment reference.</p>
  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds go back to the original payment method within 5–7 working days of approval. Bank or UPI processing times may add a few days.</p>
  <h2>When a refund may be refused</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The request comes more than 7 days after payment.</li>
    <li>The account has shared, copied or redistributed paid content in breach of our <a href="../terms/">terms</a>.</li>
    <li>Repeated purchase-and-refund of the same pack.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Cancellation</h2>
  <p>Packs are one-time purchases, not subscriptions, so there is nothing to cancel. Bundles are refunded as a whole.</p>
  <h2>Duplicate or failed payments</h2>
  <p>If you were charged twice or the payment failed but money left your account, write to us with the reference; we refund the extra amount in full.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>[BUSINESS NAME], [ADDRESS]. Email: [SUPPORT EMAIL]. Phone: [SUPPORT PHONE].</p>
</Policy>
